# Pet Peeves vs. Golden Rules
:::

:::text id=dePRfvMMrM at=center width=75% height=280 offsetY=80 preset=body align=center color=text
### ❌ Pet Peeves
Unclear priorities • Meetings without agenda • Silent handoffs

***

### ✨ Golden Rules
Bias for action • Clear async communication • Continuous feedback
